{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Gadget Master: A Secret Agency Lab</i> is a puzzle-construction game where you play as a young, exceptionally talented engineer working in a secret special forces lab. Your task is to design and assemble cube gadgets based on short descriptions of the problems agents face, then quickly deliver a working blueprint using the cubes they carry.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every second and every cube matters. A mission can succeed or fail depending on how well you handle the challenges: time pressure, limited budget, and increasingly complex tasks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cube gadget creation \u2013 over 50 cube types with different functions and uses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story campaign \u2013 demanding missions where each mistake may cost you your career.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sandbox mode \u2013 free experimentation and construction of your own inventions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test chambers \u2013 check your devices before sending them into the field.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you manage to become the ultimate gadget master and stay at the top of your career in the agency?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2834070/extras/85cdd3bde14c40cecfe6882342e59c63.avif?t=1758394782\" width=1280 height=720 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2834070?t=1758394782","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2834070/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758394782","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2834070/40671515c0b77af6009a4d105e9e86144d876f14/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758394782","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamst